<title>MONACO: SOCCER-MONACO V INTERNAZIONALE TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MONACO V INTERNAZIONALE TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the UEFA Cup semifinal second leg between Monaco of France and Internazionle of Italy on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Monaco - 1-Fabien Barthez; 2-Patrick Blondeau, 5-Franck Dumas, 4-Martin Djetou, 19-Lilian Martin; 6-Emmanuel Petit, 15-Sylvain Legwinski, 7-John Collins, 10-Enzo Scifo; 24-Victor Ikpeba, 9-Sonny Anderson.</p>
<p>Internazionale - 1-Gianluca Pagliuca; 20-Jocelyn Angloma, 19-Massimo Paganin, 7-Salvatore Fresi, 2-Giuseppe Bergomi; 4-Javier Zanetti, 8-Paul Ince, 21-Ciriaco Sforza, 14-Aron Winter; 6-Youri Djorkaeff, 23-Maurizio Ganz.</p>
</text>
